84.2,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.05915693190505909,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":false,"_score_margin_vs_hist":26.1,"_gate_piotroski":5,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":55.6,"_gate_spread":0.20408339917859236,"_gp_spread":true,"_score_spread":100.0,"_gate_roic_consistency":3.152418365612317,"_gp_roic_consistency":false,"_score_roic_consistency":0.0,"_gate_incr_roic":0.42959230878694227,"_gp_incr_roic":true,"_score_incr_roic":100.0,"_gate_margin_advantage":0.04896857109581748,"_gp_margin_advantage":false,"_score_margin_advantage":49.7,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":0.07701859503731985,"_gp_fund_growth":true,"_score_fund_growth":77.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.07165353439952121,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":90.7,"_gate_share_shrink":0.00022984098190370617,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":49.7,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.069439404848524,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.03366,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":22.4,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Payoneer Global Inc. operates as a financial technology company. The company offers customers with a multi-currency account to serve their cross-border accounts receivable and accounts payable needs through payment infrastructure platform. It delivers a suite of services, such as funds management, working capital, multicurrency accounts, and workforce management. It also provides various payment options with minimal integration required, full back-office functions, and customer support. The company serves small and medium-sized businesses worldwide. Payoneer Global Inc. was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","ceo_bio":"Mr. John R. Caplan | CEO & Director | Age 55 | Compensation: $1.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 2K people. Revenue per employee of $414K ranks in the above the sector median among Technology peers, improving at 22%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $81K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $29K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["Payoneer Global Inc. is a mid-cap technology business with a $2.4B market cap on $1.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +19% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +4.6pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 31% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 20-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $207M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 20 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 3.19\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 7.2% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 3.4% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.4) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.8513800424628462},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.5% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 50% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Valued at a 29% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Payoneer Global (NASDAQ:PAYO) Reaches New 12-Month High \u2013 What\u2019s Next?","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/payoneer-global-nasdaqpayo-reaches-new-12-month-high-whats-next.html","date":"2026-11-07","timestamp":1794010864.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.802,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Payoneer Global (PAYO), What Is Behind The Fresh Attention?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nasdaq-payo/payoneer-global/news/payoneer-global-payo-what-is-behind-the-fresh-attention","date":"2026-11-06